{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Waky Alarm 是一款以任務鬧鐘、每日語錄與專注計時器為核心的起床工具，適合容易賴床、早晨缺乏動力或讀書工作容易分心的人。原價 US $1.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-114.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>任務鬧鐘與專注計時</h2>\n<p>設定鬧鐘後，必須完成指定任務才能關閉提示，讓大腦更快清醒，減少關掉鬧鐘再睡回籠覺。每日語錄會隨鬧鐘送上新句子，為早晨注入動力；亦可自訂鬧鐘畫面，加入個人訊息或選擇主題。內置專注計時器在離開 App 後仍會運作，並於時間結束時提醒，適合讀書或工作時。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-554-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-555-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-556-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-557-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-558-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-559-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Waky Alarm – Start proud today</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6748906275\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:21:16.339610+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:17:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:38.523220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:32.457254+00:00","content_hash":"6d0f2bb9890176d53d09e5c852af2df0d010e84839eeb5b36a433532bce7aafc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}